  "bio": "Scott Crook is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black & gray, traditional, and realism styles, based out of Black Heart Tattoo in Epsom, United Kingdom. With a strong focus on craftsmanship since 2012, Scott’s attention to detail and artistic finesse are evident in every piece he expertly inks onto his clients' skin. His dedication to artistry ensures that each tattoo is not only a form of expression but also a masterpiece of impeccable design.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Epsom, England, United Kingdom\n\n•Enquires: Dm or email \n•scottcrook25@outlook.com\n•@mindseye_tattoo Banstead\n@char_crookxo 💍",
